    "cadenceChanges": "Shattered the uniform 25-word bureaucratic sentence structure. Introduced varied rhythmic pacing, alternating between layered 20-word clauses and deliberate three-to-six word punches.",
    "structuralTweaks": "Extracted the author's signature single-line rhetorical punch ('It isn't.') as an independent structural anchor between diagnosis and resolution, and transformed the passive concluding plea into an imperative call to craft.",
    "vocabularySubstitutions": [
      {
        "from": "strategic optimization of our internal documentation workflows",
        "to": "clear notes, better work / single workshop for our records",
        "reason": "Replaces abstract consulting jargon with concrete, physical terminology."
      },
